<title>GREECE: ALPHA CREDIT'S PANAYIOTOPOULOS PROMOTED TO ASST TREASURER.</title>
<headline>ALPHA CREDIT'S PANAYIOTOPOULOS PROMOTED TO ASST TREASURER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panos Panayiotopoulos, formerly chief money market dealer at private Alpha Credit Bank , was promoted to the position of assistant treasurer, market sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>Panayiotopoulos, also known as Pan-Pan locally, will head the money market desk, the swaps desk and the spot forex desk, the sources said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
